+//  Implementation of Network-Assisted Dynamic Adaptation's (NADA's) proposal.
+//  Version according to Draft Document (mentioned in references)
+//  http://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-zhu-rmcat-nada-06
+//  From March 26, 2015.
